From: iStoreOS HomeProxy Edition
Subject: [PATCH] Makefile: declare explicit package metadata for out-of-tree SDK builds

luci.mk normally derives PKG_VERSION from the surrounding LuCI git tree.
When this package is built standalone against the OpenWrt SDK (no LuCI
checkout around it), PKG_VERSION is empty and the produced .ipk has no
version. Declare PKG_VERSION/PKG_RELEASE and standard metadata so the SDK
build is reproducible. No functional or dependency changes.
---
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -12,6 +12,12 @@
 	+kmod-nft-tproxy
 
 PKG_NAME:=luci-app-homeproxy
+PKG_VERSION:=1.0.0
+PKG_RELEASE:=1
+
+PKG_MAINTAINER:=iStoreOS HomeProxy Edition
+PKG_LICENSE:=GPL-2.0-only
+PKG_LICENSE_FILES:=LICENSE
 
 define Package/luci-app-homeproxy/conffiles
 /etc/config/homeproxy
